<title>USA: PaineWebber wins $65 mln Wichita, Kan., revs.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins $65 mln Wichita, Kan., revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said it won $65.9 million of Wichita, Kan., water and sewer utility revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 4.98 percent.</p>
</text>
